            "review_title": "Review at La Petite Hutte",
            "review_text": "muflone\n7 contributions\n0\nA bit perplexed.\nJun 2026 • Solo\nThe selection of fish is somewhat limited. Good seafood salad as an appetizer, followed by shrimp and squid in hot garlic sauce with fried potatoes on the side.\nIt's a shame they serve the appetizer warm and the main course hot together, and after a while, the fried potatoes are soft and inedible. The service is good.\nRead more\nTranslated from Italian\nShow original\nWritten June 11, 2026\nLa Petite Hutte\nThank you for your feedback. We’re glad you enjoyed the service and seafood salad. \nWe apologize for the issue with the timing of the dishes. Your comments help us improve, and we’ll work to provide a better experience in the future.\nRead more\nWritten June 18, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
